","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_819d27514610a49ffa96:r5:e7d77be2f0e0393a","span_id":"ES-SD-EXPOSURE"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_819d27514610a49ffa96:revision:5","quote":"适应症：膀胱过度活动症（OAB）","quote_sha256":"81551c08a2b5162361e96cb60a1697d1c176bff61a359dd80d0b25e62c9bd1e2","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_819d27514610a49ffa96:r5:e7d77be2f0e0393a","span_id":"ES-SD-IND"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_819d27514610a49ffa96:revision:5","quote":"剂量与给药方案：R2RT-OAB-201（口服β3肾上腺素能受体激动剂缓释片）：40 mg或80 mg口服每日两次（早/晚各一次），整片吞服，不受进餐影响；8周双盲治疗期连续给药；依从性以片剂计数与排尿日记双核对，80%-120%为可评估。","quote_sha256":"b8ce8af039586ae3aa3f619c2d6db6f23f62e5850d990fd5a5784eaf4ef01d56","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_819d27514610a49ffa96:r5:e7d77be2f0e0393a","span_id":"ES-SD-DOSE"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["ES-SD-DRUG","ES-SD-TECH","ES-SD-ROUTE","ES-SD-FORM","ES-SD-EXPOSURE","ES-SD-IND","ES-SD-DOSE"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":7},"gap_items":[{"action":"获取研究者手册或研究药物研发资料后补充","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"GAP-6-1-1-01","missing_source_classes":["研究药物详细作用机制、非临床与既往临床资料"],"target":"6.1.1 研究药物信息中的详细作用机制、非临床与既往临床资料"},{"action":"获取研究者手册或风险资料后补充；未取得前不写入风险结论","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"GAP-6-1-1-02","missing_source_classes":["研究者手册或研究药物风险资料"],"target":"6.1.1 研究药物信息中的研究药物具体风险"}],"heading":"研究药物信息","missing_source_classes":["研究药物详细作用机制、非临床与既往临床资料","研究者手册或研究药物风险资料"],"proposal_text":"R2RT-OAB-201为口服β3肾上腺素能受体激动剂缓释片，属于小分子药物，剂型为口服固体制剂，暴露范围为全身暴露，拟用于膀胱过度活动症（OAB）的治疗。本研究中R2RT-OAB-201设40 mg和80 mg两个剂量水平，均为口服、每日两次（早/晚各一次），整片吞服，不受进餐影响，连续8周双盲治疗期持续给药。研究期间依从性以片剂计数与排尿日记双核对，80%-120%为可评估。","rationale":"本章正文依据当前项目研究事实中的试验药物、药物技术类型、给药途径、剂型、系统暴露、剂量与给药方案和适应症信息撰写。医学作者需核对详细作用机制、非临床与既往临床资料是否有可用项目文件，并在需要时补充；未取得前正文不延伸至未确认的药理学或风险结论。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_e068895908c9_bc32b80e7f5e3203","section_number":"6.1.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:d605f3041e16ec567d50a5bb","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_819d27514610a49ffa96:r5:e7d77be2f0e0393a","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fc6f8c9ea6d34b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:e35a8dbd3c7941"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260929201716_262d2316","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"gap_items":[{"action":"获取试验用药品制备、包装、标签、储存、发放回收与销毁的项目文件后补写","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"GAP-6-1-2-01","missing_source_classes":["试验用药品制备工艺与质量标准文件","包装、标签样稿与盲态包装文件","储存条件、温控与稳定性文件","发放、回收、销毁与药物管理SOP"],"target":"6.1.2 制备、包装、标签、储存与管理全文"}],"heading":"制备、包装、标签、储存与管理","missing_source_classes":["试验用药品制备工艺与质量标准文件","包装、标签样稿与盲态包装文件","储存条件、温控与稳定性文件","发放、回收、销毁与药物管理SOP"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"当前允许来源未提供试验用药品制备、包装、标签、储存、发放回收与管理的项目文件，仅可确认安慰剂外观、气味和包装与试验药一致。医学作者需取得药学、临床供应和质量相关项目文件后补写本章；在此之前不应以通用管理原则替代项目事实。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_e068895908c9_316d430845a97e6e","section_number":"6.1.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:d605f3041e16ec567d50a5bb","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_819d27514610a49ffa96:r5:e7d77be2f0e0393a","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fc6f8c9ea6d34b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:e35a8dbd3c7941"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"060d9077a1005f96e6ac91989